 "DixonFixT2"], "InlineFormula",ExpressionUUID->
  "709a7a9b-f681-7c46-ba60-608ac6b971e5"],
 "\[LineSeparator]is an option for ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  ButtonBox["DixonReconstruct",
   BaseStyle->"Link",
   ButtonData->"paclet:QMRITools/ref/DixonReconstruct"]], "InlineFormula",
  ExpressionUUID->"f4c562c4-3292-7f4b-a858-45752ff35026"],
 ". If set to true the R2' is fitted rather then the R2*. This is done by \
fixing T2-water to 30ms and T2-fat to 100ms."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->212898563,ExpressionUUID->"0c85e11e-d7bf-9b48-bfd6-3b74a7a958df"],

